### Create Feedback - Meeting Related
POST {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Meeting Effectiveness Feedback",
  "content": "The meeting was well-organized and productive. All agenda items were covered thoroughly.",
  "category": "meeting",
  "submittedBy": "{{userId}}",
  "meetingId": "{{meetingId}}"
}
