### Create Feedback - Other Category
POST {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "General Feedback",
  "content": "Overall performance has been satisfactory. Room for improvement in time management.",
  "category": "other",
  "submittedBy": "{{userId}}"
}

