### Get Feedback by ID
GET {{host}}/{{feedbackId}}

### Get Feedback by ID (Invalid)
GET {{host}}/invalid-id

### Update Feedback
PATCH {{host}}/{{feedbackId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Task Completion Feedback",
  "content": "The task was completed successfully with excellent attention to detail. The team member showed outstanding problem-solving skills and initiative.",
  "category": "task"
}

### Update Feedback (Invalid ID)
PATCH {{host}}/invalid-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This should fail",
  "content": "This update should not work"
}

### Delete Feedback
DELETE {{host}}/{{feedbackId}}

### Delete Feedback (Invalid ID)
DELETE {{host}}/invalid-id

### Get Feedback by User (if route exists)
GET {{host}}/user/{{userId}}
